  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.02 Parties to Adjudicatory Proceedings: The parties to a proceeding conducted pursuant to Part Puc 204 shall consist of",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.02 Parties to Adjudicatory Proceedings: The parties to a proceeding conducted pursuant to Part Puc 204 shall consist of:\n\n(a) The petitioners;\n\n(b) The department;\n\n(c) The OCA, upon notifying the commission in writing of its intention to participate as a party; and\n\n(d) Any other entity granted intervenor status pursuant to RSA 541-A:32 and Puc 204.08.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
